5,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21960,"speakerName":"「シトン」","textMapHash":3498043210,"text":"「のびのびリゾートの名のもとに、歓迎のダンスを——輝け！アイドルピピルパン！」","nextNodeIds":[752780106]},{"nodeId":752780106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":640165490,"text":"あっ！そのセリフ、また来たな！？","nextNodeIds":[752780107]},{"nodeId":752780107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21960,"speakerName":"「シトン」","textMapHash":1456922986,"text":"#えへへ、シトンだよ。覚えてる？久しぶりだね、{NICKNAME}{M#お兄}{F#お姉}ちゃん、パイモンお姉ちゃん。","nextNodeIds":[752780108]},{"nodeId":752780108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2696954018,"text":"な、なあんだ、シトンだったのか。また怖いやつかと思ったぞ！","nextNodeIds":[752780109,752780110]},{"nodeId":752780109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":982748042,"text":"何か嬉しいことでもあった？","nextNodeIds":[752780111]},{"nodeId":752780111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21960,"speakerName":"「シトン」","textMapHash":3144367658,"text":"エへへ、あのね、今はパパ自ら指導してくれてるの。あたしを一人前の役者に鍛え上げてくれるって…！","nextNodeIds":[752780112]},{"nodeId":752780112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3555092234,"text":"口じゃ厳しいけど、結局おまえに目をかけてるんだな！おかしなことを教えなきゃもっとよかったんだけど…","nextNodeIds":[752780113]},{"nodeId":752780113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21960,"speakerName":"「シトン」","textMapHash":4172978514,"text":"そうだ、これ、あげる！","nextNodeIds":[752780114]},{"nodeId":752780114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2583739330,"text":"こ、これはおまえのステージ衣装だろ？これがなかったら、おまえは…","nextNodeIds":[752780115]},{"nodeId":752780115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21960,"speakerName":"「シトン」","textMapHash":1672072730,"text":"エへへ、心配いらないよ。パパがもっと体にピッタリ合うステージ衣装を作ってくれたから！今度はもう舞台で転んだりしないよ！","nextNodeIds":[752780116]},{"nodeId":752780116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21960,"speakerName":"「シトン」","textMapHash":108400274,"text":"前のステージ衣装…友情の証に、受け取ってくれる？","nextNodeIds":[752780117]},{"nodeId":752780117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21960,"speakerName":"「シトン」","textMapHash":2273532274,"text":"次に会うときは、新しいステージ衣装を着て、二人のために歓迎のダンスを捧げるね！だからまた絶対に来て応援して。待ってるから！","nextNodeIds":[752780118]},{"nodeId":752780118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3319901714,"text":"おう、約束だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[752780119]},{"nodeId":752780119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3976476202,"text":"シトン！特訓の時間だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[752780120]},{"nodeId":752780120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21960,"speakerName":"「シトン」","textMapHash":577674818,"text":"#ウン、もう時間がないから、筋トレに行くね！{NICKNAME}{M#お兄}{F#お姉}ちゃん、パイモンお姉ちゃん、またね！","nextNodeIds":[752780121]},{"nodeId":752780121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4115700234,"text":"おう、またな！","nextNodeIds":[752780122]},{"nodeId":752780122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1785698434,"text":"（本当に行くの？）","nextNodeIds":[752780123]},{"nodeId":752780123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2210643410,"text":"そりゃ行くさ！まあ…その時は普通の「アイドル」のパフォーマンスが見られればいいな、とは思うけどな…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":752780110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1969974722,"text":"最近どう？","nextNodeIds":[752780111]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7527801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_11479:681.697,205.148,14270.990]","20"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_DISA